Beverages, like [[Cuisines]], are used overnight to serve customers visiting the izakaya or during the day to fulfill tasks. A selection of beverages is chosen to form a menu for the night, but beverages not on the menu can still be served to rare customers. Unlike cuisines, extra ingredients may not be added to beverages. As a note, customers have a separate set of preferred properties for beverages.

